{"about_the_game":"<strong>Keep Defending</strong> is a first-person VR tower defense archery game where you build up your defenses during the enemy onslaught.<br><br>Target enemies before they reach your gate and earn gold to set up ever more capable defenses including crossbows, fireball-shooting wizards, brave knights, cannons, and more as you try and deal with the approaching hordes in a variety of different environments and scenarios.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/527720/extras/bfde8f9cc0bf268455e04938de931a3d.poster.avif?t=1751405359\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/527720/extras/bfde8f9cc0bf268455e04938de931a3d.webm?t=1751405359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/527720/extras/bfde8f9cc0bf268455e04938de931a3d.mp4?t=1751405359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u><strong>Features</strong></u><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A host of enemies from Barbarian hordes to Skeleton armies and greater (much greater) dangers.<br></li><li> A range of defenses for you to employ during play to ensure the enemies don't get through.<br></li><li> Different scenarios to test your defensive tactics from small villages to large castles, frozen wastes, underground caves, and beyond.<br></li><li> Ambush scenarios where you must destroy the enemy before they escape the lethal range of your attackers.<br></li><li> Advance scenarios where you progress through different zones and build up your defenses for a grand finale!<br></li><li> Weather conditions and time of day effects offer additional gameplay challenges.<br></li><li> Beware boss enemies that destroy your defenses with a single hit.<br></li><li> Precision scoring - earn higher scores the further away targets are hit.<br></li><li> Steam leaderboards, stats, and achievements.<br></li><li> Support for HTC Vive, Oculus Rift (with Touch controllers), and Windows Mixed Reality headsets.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"5f801b5e68bf71cc5364f9d77ea09187e3092fb2.jpg","localized_name":"Homestead Completed (Hard)","name":"Homestead Completed (Hard)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/527720/5f801b5e68bf71cc5364f9d77ea09187e3092fb2.jpg"},{"icon":"705b26bb8970ea43b3849db997611ebcea349e5e.jpg","localized_name":"Early Access Participation","name":"Early Access Participation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/527720/705b26bb8970ea43b3849db997611ebcea349e5e.jpg"},{"icon":"4a6e94c8da827a7f6fca44cdba38c0a98be6c15d.jpg","localized_name":"Eagle Heights Completed (Hard)","name":"Eagle Heights Completed (Hard)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/527720/4a6e94c8da827a7f6fca44cdba38c0a98be6c15d.jpg"},{"icon":"61b44616e6fc16219e83d834cfcb4a7e71331915.jpg","localized_name":"The (Small) Wall Completed (Hard)","name":"The (Small) Wall Completed (Hard)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/527720/61b44616e6fc16219e83d834cfcb4a7e71331915.jpg"},{"icon":"72961420cf72d176c62a1fb8b2fa7f95f2889f55.jpg","localized_name":"Highguard Completed (Hard)","name":"Highguard Completed (Hard)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/527720/72961420cf72d176c62a1fb8b2fa7f95f2889f55.jpg"},{"icon":"c7fcbd66fa07d33c5772984733a969263d2ed470.jpg","localized_name":"Slay 5 Dragons","name":"Slay 5 Dragons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/527720/c7fcbd66fa07d33c5772984733a969263d2ed470.jpg"},{"icon":"f7e98de4d688252578ffbdcdfa285d9877a9b0b1.jpg","localized_name":"Crystal Caves Completed (Hard)","name":"Crystal Caves Completed (Hard)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommuni